For more granular permissions, you could also use Django's built-in permissions system instead of just checking for superuser status:

from django.contrib.auth.mixins import PermissionRequiredMixin

class EmployeeCreateView(PermissionRequiredMixin, CreateView):
    permission_required = 'first_app.add_employee'
    # ... rest of your view code

